<article class="env-lemma" id="0FMC">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0FMC">Lemma <span data-tag="0FMC">50.8.3</span>.</a> Assume $X \to S$ and $Y \to S$ are smooth and quasi-compact and the morphisms $X \to X \times _ S X$ and $Y \to Y \times _ S Y$ are affine. Then the relative cup product </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  Ra_*\Omega ^\bullet _{X/S} \otimes _{\mathcal{O}_ S}^\mathbf {L} Rb_*\Omega ^\bullet _{Y/S} \longrightarrow Rf_*\Omega ^\bullet _{X \times _ S Y/S}  \]
</div>
  <p> is an isomorphism in $D(\mathcal{O}_ S)$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Immediate consequence of Lemma <a href="/tag/0FMB" data-tag="0FMB">50.8.2</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>